<h1>Welcome to Our Valentine's Site</h1>

<p>Current subdomain: <strong><%= @subdomain %></strong> ❤️</p>

<div style="text-align: center; font-size: 48px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <span class="heart-decoration">❤️</span>
  <span class="heart-decoration" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">💕</span>
  <span class="heart-decoration" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">💖</span>
  <span class="heart-decoration" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">💗</span>
  <span class="heart-decoration" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;">💝</span>
</div>

<h2>Spread the Love - Try these subdomains</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>admin.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Admin Love Dashboard 💘 (specific subdomain constraint)</li>
  <li><strong>api.lvh.me:3000</strong> - API Love Endpoint 💌 (specific subdomain constraint)</li>
  <li><strong>acme.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Tenant "acme" with Love 💕 (wildcard subdomain)</li>
  <li><strong>demo.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Tenant "demo" with Love 💓 (wildcard subdomain)</li>
  <li><strong>sweetheart.lvh.me:3000</strong> - Any romantic name works! 💖</li>
</ul>

<p><em>💘 Note: lvh.me is a domain that points to 127.0.0.1, which allows testing subdomains locally with all the love! 💘</em></p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; font-size: 24px; color: #d81b60;">
  <p style="border: none; background: transparent;">Happy Valentine's Day! 💝</p>
</div>
